We know it's frustrating to lose a dispute, especially after submitting evidence.
The customer’s bank reviews and decides disputes using its own internal process. Outcomes can depend on several factors and often come down to the bank’s discretion. Because this review happens entirely on the bank’s side, the decision is final and we don’t receive specific explanations for individual rulings.
While our Chargeback Manager tool enables you to submit evidence directly to the bank, neither our team nor your payment processor can influence or appeal the final decision.
Please email mailto:support@marianatek.com if you have any questions. Do not respond to this email. We would be happy to help.
Thank you!
All the best,
Mariana Tek Support Team
